OL,3,GNEWSASummer heatwave put bin crews
OL,4,Alives at risk, says council worker
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome bin collections were missed over
OL,7,Fthe summer in a county partly because
OL,8,Fthe heatwave became so serious it posed
OL,9,Fa risk to the lives of workers, a
OL,10,Fcouncil worker has said.
OL,12,FFlintshire County Council's Chris
OL,13,FGoddard said crews faced a "perfect
OL,14,Fstorm" of challenges during the UK's
OL,15,Frecord-breaking hot weather, causing a
OL,16,Fspate of widespread missed collections.
OL,18,FDuring the summer, drought was declared
OL,19,Fin all of Wales and wildfires caused
OL,20,Fdevastation in parts of the country.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,437,430,260,140,0,100
