OL,3,GNEWSASummer heatwave put bin crews
OL,4,Alives at risk, says council worker
OL,5,
OL,6,FGoddard said: "We do have to make some
OL,7,Fdifficult decisions but ultimately if
OL,8,Fthere is a fatality in the workplace
OL,9,Fbecause of a decision I've made, that's
OL,10,Fsomething that I would have to live
OL,11,Fwith ` and probably defend."
